{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.divRemBasecase_spec\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">divRemBasecase_spec</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">u </span><span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hn</span> : <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Slice/Operations.html#Std.Slice.size\">Std.Slice.size</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hvt</span> : <span class=\"fn\">v</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Slice/Operations.html#Std.Slice.size\">Std.Slice.size</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Ne\">≠</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN32/Basic.html#MPN.W32.toNat\">toNat</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.divRemBasecase\">divRemBasecase</a> <span class=\"fn\">t</span> <span class=\"fn\">u</span> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">hn</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.toSlice\">toSlice</a></span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN32/Basic.html#MPN.W32.toNat\">toNat</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN32/Basic.html#MPN.W32.toNat\">toNat</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.divRemBasecase\">divRemBasecase</a> <span class=\"fn\">t</span> <span class=\"fn\">u</span> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">hn</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.toSlice\">toSlice</a></span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN32/Basic.html#MPN.W32.toNat\">toNat</a> <span class=\"fn\">u</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a>   <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN32/Basic.html#MPN.W32.toNat\">toNat</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.divRemBasecase\">divRemBasecase</a> <span class=\"fn\">t</span> <span class=\"fn\">u</span> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">hn</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.toSlice\">toSlice</a></span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN32/Basic.html#MPN.W32.toNat\">toNat</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`divRemBasecase` divides: `u = q v + r` with `r < v`.","docLink":"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.divRemBasecase_spec","kind":"theorem","line":223,"name":"MPN.W32.divRemBasecase_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Div/Basecase.lean#L223-L278"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.divRemBasecase\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">divRemBasecase</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">u </span><span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hn</span> : <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Slice/Operations.html#Std.Slice.size\">Std.Slice.size</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`u / v` and `u % v` by Knuth's Algorithm D, for a divisor of at least two limbs, untrimmed, by\n`main`'s `Schoolbook.divRemN`: `u` and `v` normalized by a shift, the quotient limbs from the top\ndown in one array, from `t` limbs in the divisor by GMP's 3-by-2 steps with the reciprocal\n`WordArray.recip32`, checked, and the remainder shifted back. It is exact when the top limb of `v`\nis not zero. A dividend of fewer limbs than `v` is its own remainder; were the slices too large for\n`USize` indices, which none is, the results would come from the values instead.","docLink":"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.divRemBasecase","kind":"def","line":201,"name":"MPN.W32.divRemBasecase","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Div/Basecase.lean#L201-L221"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.div2RowsU\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">div2RowsU</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`config.div2Rows` as a `USize`, at most `4294967295`.","docLink":"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.div2RowsU","kind":"def","line":198,"name":"MPN.W32.div2RowsU","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Div/Basecase.lean#L198-L199"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.qEstimate3_ge\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">qEstimate3_ge</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">q </span><span class=\"fn\">wt </span><span class=\"fn\">wn </span><span class=\"fn\">wl </span><span class=\"fn\">vt </span><span class=\"fn\">vs</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">qt</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hle</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">q</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">vt</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">wt</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">32</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">wn</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h₀</span> : <span class=\"fn\">qt</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">q</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h₁</span> : <span class=\"fn\">qt</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">vt</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">32</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">vs</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">wt</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">32</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">wn</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">32</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">wl</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">qt</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.qEstimate3\">qEstimate3</a> <span class=\"fn\">q</span> <span class=\"fn\">wt</span> <span class=\"fn\">wn</span> <span class=\"fn\">wl</span> <span class=\"fn\">vt</span> <span class=\"fn\">vs</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`qEstimate3` is never too small: it is at least a quotient `qt` that the first estimate `q`\nbounds and with `qt (vt β + vs) ≤ (wt β + wn) β + wl`.","docLink":"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.qEstimate3_ge","kind":"theorem","line":138,"name":"MPN.W32.qEstimate3_ge","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Div/Basecase.lean#L138-L178"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.qEstimate3\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">qEstimate3</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">q </span><span class=\"fn\">wt </span><span class=\"fn\">wn </span><span class=\"fn\">wl </span><span class=\"fn\">vt </span><span class=\"fn\">vs</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The estimate `q` of a quotient limb, from `qEstimate`, corrected twice with `qRefine` using the\nnext limb `wl` of the window and the second limb `vs` of the divisor. Then it is at most one too\nlarge, and rarely, so that `v` is seldom added back.\n\nIt takes `q` as a parameter and computes `wt β` with a shift: when the kernel compares terms that\ncontain a multiplication by the literal `2³²`, it may unfold it into a recursion on the literal.","docLink":"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.qEstimate3","kind":"def","line":62,"name":"MPN.W32.qEstimate3","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Div/Basecase.lean#L62-L80"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.qRefine\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">qRefine</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">q</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">r</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">wl </span><span class=\"fn\">vt </span><span class=\"fn\">vs</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"One correction of the estimate `q` with the next limb `wl` of the window and the second limb `vs`\nof the divisor, as in Knuth's Algorithm D: `r` is `wt β + wn - q vt`, and `q` decreases when\n`q vs > r β + wl`, which means that `q (vt β + vs)` exceeds the top three limbs of the window.","docLink":"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.qRefine","kind":"def","line":49,"name":"MPN.W32.qRefine","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Div/Basecase.lean#L49-L60"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.qEstimate\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">qEstimate</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">wt </span><span class=\"fn\">wn </span><span class=\"fn\">vt</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`min ⌊(wt β + wn) / vt⌋ (β - 1)`, the estimate of a quotient limb.","docLink":"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.qEstimate","kind":"def","line":44,"name":"MPN.W32.qEstimate","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Div/Basecase.lean#L44-L47"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.top_limb_le\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">top_limb_le</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hn</span> : <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Slice/Operations.html#Std.Slice.size\">Std.Slice.size</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">v</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Slice/Operations.html#Std.Slice.size\">Std.Slice.size</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> (<span class=\"fn\">32</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Slice/Operations.html#Std.Slice.size\">Std.Slice.size</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>)) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN32/Basic.html#MPN.W32.toNat\">toNat</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A divisor with top limb `vt` is at least `vt βⁿ⁻¹`.","docLink":"./MPN32/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W32.top_limb_le","kind":"theorem","line":33,"name":"MPN.W32.top_limb_le","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Div/Basecase.lean#L33-L40"}}],"imports":["Init","MPN.Div.Basecase","MPN.Div.ByLimb","MPN32.Basic","MPN32.Mul.Limb","MPN32.Settings"],"instances":[],"name":"MPN32.Div.Basecase"}